DESCRIPTION:Oakland’s 2026 “Autumn Lights Festival” (October 15-17)\
 nAutumn Lights Festival\nArt and nature enthusiasts from all over the regi
 on flock to Oakland’s Lake Merritt to immerse themselves in the must-see
  15th Anniversary Autumn Lights Festival\, a one-of-a-kind interactive art
  experience that is always the talk of the town.\nWe invite you to celebra
 te our 15th Anniversary festival in-person over three spectacular nights O
 ctober 15-17\, 2026. Prepare to be dazzled\, mesmerized and amazed at this
  magical benefit for the non-profit Friends of the Gardens at Lake Merritt
  where you will experience 75 locally produced illuminated art displays sp
 arkling and beaming throughout Oakland’s beloved eight-acre municipal ga
 rdens. Be sure to buy your tickets soon as this event always sells out.\nA
 utumn Lights Festival 2026\nOctober 15-17\, 2026 | 6-11p\nGardens at Lake 
 Merritt\, 666 Bellevue Avenue\, Oakland\nBuy Tickets – $28.52 (fees incl
 uded) for ages 18+\, $12.51 for ages 6-17\, Free for ages five and under\n
 \nAutumn Lights Festival\n\nAdditional highlights include:\n\nLive enterta
 inment\nAnnual art market\nKid’s zone\nCostume contest for adults and ki
 ds (come lit!)\nArtists awards\nPopular food court with local food trucks\
 , vendors\, and beer + wine gardens\n\nLearn more about the Autumn Lights 
 Festival and Gardens at Lake Merritt.\n\nAutumn Lights Festival\n\nAutumn 
 Lights Festival\n\nAutumn Lights Festival\n\nAutumn Lights Festival\n\nVie
 w this post on Instagram\n\nA post shared by The Gardens at Lake Merritt (
 @gardens_lake_...\n\n$28.52\n\nTickets: https://ALF2026.eventbrite.com\nDe
 tails: https://sf.funcheap.com/oaklands-2026-autumn-lights-festival-octobe
 r-1517/\nSource: Funcheap SF
