BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Gourmet Ghost Tour of North Beach
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261016T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261016T193000
DTSTAMP:20261015T113924Z
UID:dothebay-17957230@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Food & Drink
DESCRIPTION:Venture into the heart of San Francisco’s North Beach—lovi
 ngly dubbed ‘Little Italy.’ On this food and ghost tour\, you’ll wea
 ve through a rich culinary landscape while delving into the spine-tingling
  tales that haunt this iconic district. A feast for both the palate and th
 e spirit\, this journey is an unforgettable fusion of food and phantoms.\n
 \nBegin with antipasto at the haunted San Remo Hotel\, uncover eerie tales
  of kidnapped sailors at The Saloon\, and savor slices of history at a loc
 al pizzeria. Conclude with a sweet treat tied to the Beatnik era\, blendin
 g ghostly legends with delectable discoveries.\n\nHighlights:\nUnearth the
  chilling tales of the Gold Rush Era\n\nDive into the captivating history 
 of pizza\n\nTaste famed focaccia bread\n\nTake a quick sojourn into Haunte
 d Chinatown\n\nFeel history come alive outside North Beach’s oldest bar\
 n\nRelish the local Italian flavors\n\nTaste a sweet note with a renowned 
 Italian dessert\n\n$99\nStretchy Pants Food Tours Presents:\n\nTickets: ht
 tps://www.stretchy-pants.com/tours/san-francisco-gourmet-ghost-tour/\nDeta
 ils: https://dothebay.com/events/weekly/fri/gourmet-ghost-tour-of-north-be
 ach-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7994642;-122.40891
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34964927/adcecbfa-f56c-4013-b779-c3ab945c6051.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261015T113924Z
LOCATION:North Beach\, Columbus St. & Stockton St.\, San Francisco\, CA\, 
 94133
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/weekly/fri/gourmet-ghost-tour-of-north-bea
 ch-tickets
END:VEVENT
