DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerMission LoteríaExplore the fl
 avors\, murals\, bakeries\, and cultural landmarks of San Francisco’s Ca
 lle 24 Latino Cultural District.\nJoin Mission Lotería and Calle 24 Latin
 o Cultural District for a brand-new guided Cafecito Tour along 24th Street
  in the heart of the Mission.\n\nThis weekend walking experience brings to
 gether two of the neighborhood’s greatest treasures: its rich Latino cul
 tural history and its beloved cafés and panaderías. Along the way\, gues
 ts will enjoy special tastings\, visit iconic local businesses\, discover 
 meaningful public art\, and learn more about the people and stories that h
 ave shaped Calle 24.\nBring your walking shoes\, and get ready to experien
 ce 24th Street one cafecito sip\, one pan dulce bite\, and one majestic mu
 ral at a time.\n\n$33.43\n\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/calle24-
 cafecito-tour-tickets-2002982036189?discount=SF-FUNCHEAP\nDetails: https:/
 /sf.funcheap.com/calle24-cafecito-tour/\nSource: Funcheap SF
