CATEGORIES:Food & Drink
DESCRIPTION:Mission Bay Harvest Festival\nSaturday\, October 17 | SPARK So
 cial SF\n\nCelebrate Fall at the Mission Bay Harvest Festival!\n\nGet into
  the fall spirit at the Mission Bay Harvest Festival! Join us at SPARK Soc
 ial SF on Saturday\, October 17 from 4–7 PM for an evening of seasonal f
 un featuring a pumpkin patch\, petting zoo\, live music\, food trucks\, an
 d more. Then\, stick around at 7 PM for an outdoor movie screening of Hocu
 s Pocus!\n\nBest of all\, admission is free! Bring your friends and family
  for an evening of festive activities\, delicious food\, and Halloween fun
  under the stars.\n\nEvent Details:\nSaturday\, October 17\, 2026 | 4PM–
 7PM (Outdoor Movie Begins at 7PM)\nSPARK Social SF | 601 Mission Bay Blvd 
 North\, SF\nFree Admission | Everyone Welcome\n\nFeaturing:\n\nPumpkin Pat
