DESCRIPTION:Venture into the heart of San Francisco’s North Beach—lovi
 ngly dubbed ‘Little Italy’. On this food and ghost tour\, you’ll wea
 ve through a rich culinary landscape while delving into the spine-tingling
  tales that haunt this iconic district. A feast for both the palate and th
 e spirit\, this journey is an unforgettable fusion of food and phantoms.\n
 \nHighlights:\nUnearth the chilling tales of the Gold Rush Era\n\nDive int
 o the captivating history of pizza\n\nTaste famed focaccia bread\n\nTake a
  quick sojourn into a haunted bookstore\n\nFeel history come alive outside
  North Beach’s oldest bar\n\nRelish the local Italian flavors\n\nTaste a
  sweet note with a renowned Italian dessert\n\nBegin with antipasto at the
  haunted San Remo Hotel\, uncover eerie tales of kidnapped sailors at The 
 Saloon\, and savor slices of history at a local pizzeria. Conclude with a 
 sweet treat tied to the Beatnik era\, blending ghostly legends with delect
 able discoveries.\n\n$99\nStretchy Pants Food Tours Presents:\n\nTickets: 
 https://www.stretchy-pants.com/tours/san-francisco-gourmet-ghost-tour/\nDe
