DESCRIPTION:Asians Are Strong Presents\nWorld Of Dumplings 2026\nSunday\, 
 October 25 | Ferry Building\n\nOne of San Francisco's favorite community l
 ed food festival is back for it's third year and its going to better than 
 ever!\n\nWorld of Dumplings is back for its third year and bigger than eve
 r!\n\nThis free\, family-friendly event will be held at the iconic Ferry B
 uilding on Sunday\, October 25th from 11 AM - 5 PM.\n\n'World of Dumplings
 ' celebrates our different cultures and communities through our shared lov
 e of dumplings - highlighting our similarities and celebrating our delicio
 us differences.\n\nWhether they are the wontons of China\, the gyozas of J
 apan\, the momos of Nepal\, the manties of Turkey\, raviolis of Italy\, or
  the empanadas of Spain - we love all dumplings!\n\nWhat to expect:\n\nDum
 plings from all over the world\n25+ restaurant vendors\nEating contests\nC
 ooking demos\nBeer garden\nRaffle prizes\nDumpling trivia\nFamily activiti
 es\nPerformances\nMusic\nAnd more exciting new additions to be announced!\
 n\nFollow along Big D's adventures as he prepares for this year's World of
  Dumplings!\n\nFree\nAsians Are Strong Presents\n\nTickets: https://www.ev
 entbrite.com/e/world-of-dumplings-2026-tickets-1997773482264?aff=dothebay\
 nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/25/world-of-dumplings-2026-t
