  for a celebration of tradition and enlightenment with our fourth annual D
 iwali Festival. Featuring live music\, cooking demos\, family-friendly act
 ivities\, and more! Did we mention free chai? Yep\, that too!\nDon’t mis
 s the Rangoli Workshop at the Sunset Mercantile Artship\, Sari Demo\, diya
  decorating\, henna\, and special Diwali treats from our vendors plus all 
