DESCRIPTION:2026 “SF Tea Festival” at Ferry Building (Nov. 14-15)\nSF 
 Tea Festival\nIf you love tea\, there’s probably no better event all yea
 r to attend. Explore and taste hundreds of teas from 30+ different tea mak
 ers. Vendors include established brands and local artisans. The two-day fe
 stival takes place November 14-15\, 2026\nTickets start at $19 and include
  free tastings and a souvenir porcelain tasting cup\nWant Exclusive Discou
 nted Tickets to the San Francisco Tea Festival?\nFUNCHEAP EXCLUSIVE: Funch
 eap has very limited discounted tickets (GA + porcelain tasting cup + tast
 ings from 30+ vendors).\nWe’ve got exclusive $5 off tickets for you – 
 these are very limited and will sell out. Discount code is available on th
 e first 200 uses.\n\nGet $19 Saturday Tickets w/ secret code FUNCHEAP – 
 w/ free tastings + porcelain tasting cup + canvas tote bag\nGet $19 Sunday
  Tickets w/ secret code FUNCHEAP – w/ free tastings + porcelain tasting 
 cup + canvas tote bag\n\nScore a free canvas tote bag! Stuffed with tea sa
 mples to try at home when you grab your tickets early. These are first com
 e\, first served and only available in limited quantity – once they’re
  gone\, they’re gone!\nTea Tasting Highlights\n\nImperial Tea Court — 
 SF’s award-winning Chinese teahouse\, known for premium green\, white\, 
 oolong\, and puerh teas for 20+ years.\nThe Republic of Tea — Found in 1
 992\, this specialty tea brand offers a wide selection of premium teas\, h
 erbal blends\, books\, and nature-inspired sip ware\, with a focus on educ
 ation\, innov...\n\n$24.00\n\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/fall-s
 f-international-tea-festival-2026-tickets-1994590750628?aff=sffcweb&amp\;d
 iscount=funcheap\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/2026-sf-tea-festival-at
 -ferry-building-nov-14-15/\nSource: Funcheap SF
