BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Manzanita Night 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T190000
DTSTAMP:20261020T194441Z
UID:dothebay-17972544@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Food & Drink
DESCRIPTION:Fort Point Beer Co Presents:\nManzanita Night 2026\nSaturday\,
  November 14 | Fort Point Valencia\n\nA one-night celebration at Fort Poin
 t Valencia to honor our favorite fall tradition: the release of our Manzan
 ita Smoked Altbier.\n\nJoin us as we kick off Manzanita season with a nigh
 t we hope becomes an annual tradition.\nThe cask taps at 5:30pm. Be there 
 for the toast and first pour.\n\nCask-conditioned Manzanita: Gravity-poure
 d from a cask on the bar\, the way they still serve it in Bamberg\, the wo
 rld’s smoked beer capital. Get it before the cask runs dry.\n\nSmoked be
 er flights: Manzanita (cask & draft) alongside selections from Bamberg’s
  historic Schlenkerla and Freigeist\, the experimental brewery that we col
 labed with on the very first Manzanita batch.\n\nManzanita steins: Rastal 
 ceramic half liters\, custom printed with the Manzanita icon. Fill one at 
 the bar and take it home. Limited run\, while supplies last.\n\nFirst 4-pa
 cks of the season: Sold to go before they’re available anywhere else.\n\
 nAbout Manzanita: Brewed with charred local manzanita branches\, Manzanita
  is a beautiful dark beer that’s light-bodied and somehow nutty\, herbal
 \, sweet and savory all at once. Decisively autumnal without relying on th
 e clichés of the season\, it’s our very Northern California take on the
  classic smoked beers of Northern Bavaria and a Fort Point cult favorite.\
 n\nfree to RSVP\, food+bev for purchase\nFort Point Beer Presents:\n\nTick
 ets: https://consumer.pxf.io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe
 %2Fmanzanita-night-2026-tickets-2003216512514%3Faff%3Doddtdtcreator%26keep
 _tld%3Dtrue\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/14/manzanita-nig
 ht-2026-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\n\nAlso listed on:\n- https://sf.funchea
 p.com/fort-point-beer-presents-manzanita-night-sf/
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35035428/e8eb3e8c-59ab-47f5-a09d-b5a95af7a60f.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261020T194441Z
LOCATION:Fort Point Valencia\, 742 Valencia Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 
 94110
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/14/manzanita-night-2026-tickets
END:VEVENT
